{"id":"bfefeed9666846e4","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-indexed-grammar-rewriting.md","title":"指标栈的复制、压入与弹出","display":"df-indexed-grammar-rewriting — 指标栈的复制、压入与弹出","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-indexed-grammar-rewriting","aliases":["73-df-indexed-grammar-rewriting"],"display":"df-indexed-grammar-rewriting — 指标栈的复制、压入与弹出","depends_on":["[[73-df-indexed-grammar-structure]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"§14.3, pp. 389–390; scans 397–398","source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§14.3, pp. 389–390; scans 397–398","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-indexed-grammar-rewriting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-indexed-grammar-rewriting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-indexed-grammar-rewriting — 指标栈的复制、压入与弹出"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b948d842f8d7b5b3\" href=\"?note=b948d842f8d7b5b3\" title=\"73-df-indexed-grammar-structure\">73-df-indexed-grammar-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§14.3, pp. 389–390; scans 397–398"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§14.3, pp. 389–390; scans 397–398"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\">\\(\\operatorname{IG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b948d842f8d7b5b3\" href=\"?note=b948d842f8d7b5b3\" title=\"73-df-indexed-grammar-structure\">73-df-indexed-grammar-structure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in V\">\\(A,B\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in I^*\">\\(\\sigma\\in I^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\">\\(\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T,\\mathsf N\">\\(\\mathsf T,\\mathsf N\\)</span> 是下式给出的带标签符号构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\Omega_G^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(x,y\\in\\Omega_G^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}rewriting}\\vdash\n\\mathsf T(a)\\coloneqq(0,a),\\quad\\mathsf N(A,\\sigma)\\coloneqq(1,(A,\\sigma)),\\quad\\Omega_G\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times\\Sigma)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times(V\\times I^*))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}rewriting}\\vdash\n\\mathsf T(a)\\coloneqq(0,a),\\quad\\mathsf N(A,\\sigma)\\coloneqq(1,(A,\\sigma)),\\quad\\Omega_G\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times\\Sigma)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times(V\\times I^*))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}rewriting}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\sigma}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\begin{cases}\\mathsf T(\\alpha(i)),&amp;\\alpha(i)\\in\\Sigma,\\\\\\mathsf N(\\alpha(i),\\sigma),&amp;\\alpha(i)\\in V\\end{cases}:0\\le i&lt;|\\alpha|\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}rewriting}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\sigma}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\begin{cases}\\mathsf T(\\alpha(i)),&amp;\\alpha(i)\\in\\Sigma,\\\\\\mathsf N(\\alpha(i),\\sigma),&amp;\\alpha(i)\\in V\\end{cases}:0\\le i&lt;|\\alpha|\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}rewriting}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}x\\Rightarrow^I_Gy\\leftrightarrow\\exists u,v\\in\\Omega_G^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in I^*\\;\\Bigl[&amp;(\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;[(A,\\alpha)\\in P_0\\land x=u\\langle\\mathsf N(A,\\sigma)\\rangle v\\land y=u\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\sigma}(\\alpha)v])\\\\&amp;\\lor(\\exists B\\in V\\;\\exists f\\in I\\;[(A,B,f)\\in P_+\\land x=u\\langle\\mathsf N(A,\\sigma)\\rangle v\\land y=u\\langle\\mathsf N(B,f\\sigma)\\rangle v])\\\\&amp;\\lor(\\exists f\\in I\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;[(A,f,\\alpha)\\in P_-\\land x=u\\langle\\mathsf N(A,f\\sigma)\\rangle v\\land y=u\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\sigma}(\\alpha)v])\\Bigr].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}rewriting}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}x\\Rightarrow^I_Gy\\leftrightarrow\\exists u,v\\in\\Omega_G^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in I^*\\;\\Bigl[&amp;(\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;[(A,\\alpha)\\in P_0\\land x=u\\langle\\mathsf N(A,\\sigma)\\rangle v\\land y=u\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\sigma}(\\alpha)v])\\\\&amp;\\lor(\\exists B\\in V\\;\\exists f\\in I\\;[(A,B,f)\\in P_+\\land x=u\\langle\\mathsf N(A,\\sigma)\\rangle v\\land y=u\\langle\\mathsf N(B,f\\sigma)\\rangle v])\\\\&amp;\\lor(\\exists f\\in I\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;[(A,f,\\alpha)\\in P_-\\land x=u\\langle\\mathsf N(A,f\\sigma)\\rangle v\\land y=u\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\sigma}(\\alpha)v])\\Bigr].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}rewriting}\\vdash\nR^I_G\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in(\\Omega_G^{&lt;\\omega})^2:x\\Rightarrow^I_Gy\\},\\quad x\\Rightarrow^{I*}_Gy\\leftrightarrow(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\Omega_G^{&lt;\\omega}}(R^I_G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}rewriting}\\vdash\nR^I_G\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in(\\Omega_G^{&lt;\\omega})^2:x\\Rightarrow^I_Gy\\},\\quad x\\Rightarrow^{I*}_Gy\\leftrightarrow(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\Omega_G^{&lt;\\omega}}(R^I_G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>指标串的首字符是栈顶。普通规则把同一个栈复制给右部所有非终结符；压入规则只加一个首指标；弹出规则只在匹配栈顶时适用，并把余栈复制给右部变量。终结字符不携带指标。Ω 可能无限，但每个句型仍是有限序列。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-indexed-grammar-structure","status":"resolved","id":"b948d842f8d7b5b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-indexed-grammar-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-indexed-grammar-structure","status":"resolved","id":"b948d842f8d7b5b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $G=(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)$ 满足 $\\operatorname{IG}_{\\Sigma}(G)$，见 [[73-df-indexed-grammar-structure]]。$a\\in\\Sigma$、$A,B\\in V$、$\\sigma\\in I^*$、$\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*$；$\\mathsf T,\\mathsf N$ 是下式给出的带标签符号构造。$x,y\\in\\Omega_G^{<\\omega}$。闭包见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $G=(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)$ 满足 $\\operatorname{IG}_{\\Sigma}(G)$，见 [[73-df-indexed-grammar-structure]]。$a\\in\\Sigma$、$A,B\\in V$、$\\sigma\\in I^*$、$\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*$；$\\mathsf T,\\mathsf N$ 是下式给出的带标签符号构造。$x,y\\in\\Omega_G^{<\\omega}$。闭包见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IG}_{\\Sigma}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in I^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf T,\\mathsf N","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\Omega_G^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}rewriting}\\vdash\n\\mathsf T(a)\\coloneqq(0,a),\\quad\\mathsf N(A,\\sigma)\\coloneqq(1,(A,\\sigma)),\\quad\\Omega_G\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times\\Sigma)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times(V\\times I^*))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}rewriting}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\sigma}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\begin{cases}\\mathsf T(\\alpha(i)),&\\alpha(i)\\in\\Sigma,\\\\\\mathsf N(\\alpha(i),\\sigma),&\\alpha(i)\\in V\\end{cases}:0\\le i<|\\alpha|\\right\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}rewriting}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}x\\Rightarrow^I_Gy\\leftrightarrow\\exists u,v\\in\\Omega_G^{<\\omega}\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in I^*\\;\\Bigl[&(\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;[(A,\\alpha)\\in P_0\\land x=u\\langle\\mathsf N(A,\\sigma)\\rangle v\\land y=u\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\sigma}(\\alpha)v])\\\\&\\lor(\\exists B\\in V\\;\\exists f\\in I\\;[(A,B,f)\\in P_+\\land x=u\\langle\\mathsf N(A,\\sigma)\\rangle v\\land y=u\\langle\\mathsf N(B,f\\sigma)\\rangle v])\\\\&\\lor(\\exists f\\in I\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;[(A,f,\\alpha)\\in P_-\\land x=u\\langle\\mathsf N(A,f\\sigma)\\rangle v\\land y=u\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\sigma}(\\alpha)v])\\Bigr].\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}rewriting}\\vdash\nR^I_G\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in(\\Omega_G^{<\\omega})^2:x\\Rightarrow^I_Gy\\},\\quad x\\Rightarrow^{I*}_Gy\\leftrightarrow(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\Omega_G^{<\\omega}}(R^I_G)","display":true}],"bytes":3172,"backlinks":[{"id":"683388600cf59838","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定有效指标文法 $G=(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)$。带标签字母、指标推导关系见 [[73-df-indexed-grammar-rewriting]]。$w\\in\\Sigma^*$。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-346","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"